          "proof_context": {
            "declaration": "YM.FullVolume.Ray.Rebar",
            "lines": [
              20,
              23
            ],
            "conclusion": "`Rebar p f c` with 1 ≤ p and 0 ≤ c: for every finite stencil `w`, if `‖trace w (x/p)^i‖ ≤ v` for all i then `‖trace w f‖ ≤ v*c`, i.e. the stencil sum of the line f is at most c times the stencil quantity at radius p."
          }
